    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστᾰγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not trickling,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κρύσταλλος</span>
			<i>hard-frozen</i> ice, dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				149.4
			</span></i> (prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπαγῆ</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not merely trickling,</i> i.e. <i>gushing, in a stream,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.805
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				307
			</span></i>.</div>
